# The CI gate registry is positional: shard assignment is `index % count`. The custom driver keeps
# the base byte-order wholesale and moves only each side's additions to the tail, with each suite's
# preceding comment block attached. This preserves the safety property `!merge` protected without
# making every concurrent append a manual conflict. A clone's first `pnpm install` registers the
# local driver; `pnpm git:setup` is the explicit idempotent repair for an existing checkout.
bin/smoke/ci-suites.txt merge=cotal-ci-suites
